{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And YHWH came down upon Mount Sinai.</b> Might one say He literally came down upon it? Scripture says: ״כִּי מִן הַשָּׁמַיִם דִּבַּרְתִּי עִמָּכֶם״ (Exodus 20) — this teaches that He lowered the upper and lower heavens and spread them over the mountain like a spread over a couch, and the Throne of Glory came down upon them (Mekhilta)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:10.968391008Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}